<title>ITALY: World Bank launching 800 bln lire domestic bond.</title>
<headline>World Bank launching 800 bln lire domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Bank for Reconstruction and Development (IBRD) is launching a seven-year domestic bond worth 800 billion lire, lead manager Banca di Roma said.</p>
<p>The bond has a fixed rate and an annual coupon which will be announced a day before the offer, expected on February 26.</p>
<p>Co-leads are Banca Nazionale del Lavoro (BNL) and Monte dei Paschi di Siena.</p>
<p>It is the second domestic issue of the World Bank this year. ((  --Milan bureau +392 66129507 ))</p>
